{"applicability_conditions":null,"identity":{"block_id":"b0063","equation_id":"equation_014","equation_number":"14","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} \\frac {d \\sigma_ {\\nu}}{d \\varepsilon} = \\theta_ {0} \\frac {\\sigma_ {0}}{\\sigma_ {\\nu}} \\frac {\\sigma_ {s} ^ {2}}{\\sigma_ {s} ^ {2} - \\sigma_ {0} ^ {2}} - \\theta_ {0} \\sigma_ {0} \\frac {\\sigma_ {\\nu}}{\\sigma_ {s} ^ {2} - \\sigma_ {0} ^ {2}} \\\\ \\frac {d \\sigma}{d \\varepsilon} = \\frac {d \\sigma_ {\\nu}}{d \\varepsilon}, \\text {if} \\sigma_ {\\nu} <   \\sigma_ {c} \\\\ \\frac {d \\sigma}{d \\varepsilon} = \\frac {d \\sigma_ {\\nu}}{d \\varepsilon} - (\\sigma_ {s} - \\sigma_ {s s}) \\frac {d \\varphi_ {d}}{d \\varepsilon}, \\text {if} \\sigma_ {\\nu} \\geq \\sigma_ {c} \\end{array} \\right.\\tag{14}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.ijplas.2025.104353"},"latex":"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} \\frac{d\\sigma_{\\nu}}{d\\varepsilon} = \\theta_{0} \\frac{\\sigma_{0}}{\\sigma_{\\nu}} \\frac{\\sigma_{s}^{2}}{\\sigma_{s}^{2} - \\sigma_{0}^{2}} - \\theta_{0} \\sigma_{0} \\frac{\\sigma_{\\nu}}{\\sigma_{s}^{2} - \\sigma_{0}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{d\\sigma}{d\\varepsilon} = \\frac{d\\sigma_{\\nu}}{d\\varepsilon}, \\text{if } \\sigma_{\\nu} < \\sigma_{c} \\\\ \\frac{d\\sigma}{d\\varepsilon} = \\frac{d\\sigma_{\\nu}}{d\\varepsilon} - (\\sigma_{s} - \\sigma_{ss}) \\frac{d\\varphi_{d}}{d\\varepsilon}, \\text{if } \\sigma_{\\nu} \\geq \\sigma_{c} \\end{array} \\right.","purpose":"Expresses the differential evolution of the flow stress undergoing work hardening (WH), dynamic recovery (DRV) and dynamic recrystallization (DRX).","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\sigma_{\\nu}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"strain","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\theta_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"yield stress (resistance to initial slip of dislocations)","symbol":"\\sigma_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\sigma_{s}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"flow stress","symbol":"\\sigma","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\sigma_{c}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\sigma_{ss}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\varphi_{d}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["Derived from Eqs. (1), (8), and (13).","WH = work hardening; DRV = dynamic recovery; DRX = dynamic recrystallization.","The equation is piecewise: for sigma_nu < sigma_c the flow-stress derivative equals d(sigma_nu)/d(epsilon); for sigma_nu >= sigma_c the term (sigma_s - sigma_ss)*d(varphi_d)/d(epsilon) is subtracted (DRX-related softening).","Liu et al. (2023b) later modified Eq. (14) by adding the net change of yield stress Delta(sigma_0) (resistance to initial slip of dislocations, affected by transient temperature and strain-rate changes), giving Eq. (15)."]}